  "description": "Atomera Incorporated develops, commercializes, and licenses its unique materials, processes, and technologies for the semiconductor sector across North America and the Asia Pacific region. Central to its offerings is the Mears Silicon Technology (MST), a refined, ultra-thin silicon film designed to enhance the transistor channel of CMOS-type devices. The company serves a diverse range of clients, including foundries, integrated device manufacturers, fabless semiconductor manufacturers, original equipment manufacturers, and electronic design automation companies. Established in 2001, the firm, headquartered in Los Gatos, California, operated as Mears Technologies, Inc. until it adopted the name Atomera Incorporated in January 2016.",
